message: "If you use this software, please cite the associated manuscript and this software release."
title: "Deeptime RoC Analysis: Rates-of-Change Workflow for Deep-Time Data"
type: software
version: 1.0.1
date-released: 2026-06-12
authors:
  - family-names: Zhao
    given-names: Hongyi
    affiliation: China University of Geosciences (Beijing)
  - family-names: Zhang
    given-names: Laiming
    affiliation: China University of Geosciences (Beijing)
repository-code: "https://github.com/CUGB-zhaohy/Rates-of-Change-for-Deeptime"
url: "https://github.com/CUGB-zhaohy/Rates-of-Change-for-Deeptime"
license: MIT
abstract: >-
  A reproducible Python workflow and standalone Windows application for
  multi-timescale rate-of-change analysis of irregular deep-time records.
  The software includes IBR, Theil-Sen, IQR, LRI correction, nTV and Gini
  evaluation, PWLF breakpoint detection, method-specific KDE consensus
  detection, phase statistics, and summary figure generation.
keywords:
  - rate of change
  - deep-time data
  - paleoclimate
  - Cenozoic
  - oxygen isotope
  - time series
